{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"55c6f6d2c911aefcc08144441512250015f962b2f8ce746bc6cf2721642444e6","digest":{"component_or_area":"review-bot-ops runbook","key_entities":["infra/runbooks/review-bot-ops.md","var.aws_region","versions.tf","i-00880b2c7f13527c5","us-east-1","896586841071","autodeploy.sh","install-autodeploy.sh","BOT_PATHS","aws ssm start-session","aws ssm send-command"],"problem_keywords":["runbook documentation","missing instance metadata","SSM Session Manager","autodeploy self-update","operational guidance"],"propositions":["The review-bot-ops runbook does not state the prod instance ID or region needed to start SSM sessions, forcing operators to guess","The instance ID (i-00880b2c7f13527c5) and region (us-east-1) are defined in terraform and ADR-0026 but not documented in the operational runbook","Operators need clear SSM Session Manager connection commands (start-session/send-command) in the runbook for prod box access","The autodeploy.sh self-update behavior is undocumented: the script body auto-updates via BOT_PATHS rsync, but script-only changes require manual deployment because they trigger no rsync","The installer (install-autodeploy.sh) and systemd unit files are excluded from re-materialization to prevent self-modification races and always require manual deployment"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787682844908298001,"uuid":"bb54f6fb-1a23-49a8-a06d-c052c2106027"}